content.text:
Now ground detail improvements in game.js: `_drawSolid`, `_drawFloat`, stars.

Add scalloped grass edge and a darker line. Modify `_drawSolid` after grass cap fill:

```js
// scalloped transition
ctx.fillStyle = rgba(th.grassDark, 0.55);
for (let x = s.x + 10; x < s.x + s.w - 10; x += 30) {
  const rr = 5 + hash(x*1.3)*7;
  ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(x, s.y+23, rr, 3.2, 0,0,TAU); ctx.fill();
}
ctx.strokeStyle = rgba(th.soilDark, 0.35); line from x to x+w at y+26
```

Also add a highlight atop grass.

Roots increase alpha to 0.4 and width 1.4. Add extra small stones/soil patches maybe: within top 200, deterministic darker ellipses; current pebbles decor. Good.

Floating platform: add dark underside line, small hanging roots? vines already.

Stars: warm halo smaller and core stronger. Adjust.

Player: outline body and feet. Also maybe adjust eye position. Let's do.

Also maybe add flowers on solid tops look tiny; increase scale? okay.

Let me edit `_drawSolid`.

