content.text:
Now update tail target in _updateVisuals to 26 + min(24, ...), and snap if too far:
```js
let targetX = cx - facing*(26 + min(24, abs(vx)*.06));
if (!Number.isFinite(p.tailX) || Math.abs(p.tailX-cx)>150) {p.tailX=targetX;...}
```
Also tailY target.

input.newString:
const cx = p.x + p.w / 2;
    const targetX = cx - p.facing * (26 + Math.min(24, Math.abs(p.vx) * 0.06));
    const targetY = p.y + 18 + Math.sin(this.time * 3.4) * 3.4 - p.vy * 0.014;
    if (!Number.isFinite(p.tailX) || Math.abs(p.tailX - cx) > 150) {
      p.tailX = targetX;
      p.tailY = targetY;
    }
    p.tailX = damp(p.tailX, targetX, 7, dt);
    p.tailY = damp(p.tailY, targetY, 6, dt);

